[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096930321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108829#issuecomment-3096930321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108829","id":3096930321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64l2gR","user":{"login":"Storm-Dev6","id":188445215,"node_id":"U_kgDOCztyHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188445215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6","html_url":"https://github.com/Storm-Dev6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T14:06:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T14:06:40Z","body":"Hi @bbb651,\n\nThanks for reporting this issue — I can confirm I'm seeing the same behavior on my system as well.\n\n🔍 Observations:\nShortcuts that involve characters generated by key combinations (e.g., % via Shift + 5 on US layout) do not trigger as expected.\n\nThese characters can still be typed in text fields, so the issue is specific to the shortcut input system.\n\nIt seems the shortcut detection might rely on physical key codes, not the final character after layout transformation.\n\nDefault bindings like # (for Toggle Grid) are affected as well.\n\nReproduced on:\nSystem: Arch Linux\n\nDesktop: Niri\n\nDisplay: Both Wayland and Xwayland\n\nGodot versions: 4.4.1 and 4.5 beta 2\n\nPossible cause:\nThis might be related to how Godot handles keyboard layouts — specifically that it doesn’t account for characters produced by modifier keys (like Shift) when checking for shortcut activations.\n\nLet me know if I can help test a fix or provide more detailed logs if needed!\n\nBest regards, 👍 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096930321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132267766","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108829#issuecomment-3132267766","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108829","id":3132267766,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66spz2","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T12:26:39Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T12:26:39Z","body":"Reproducible also on MacOS\n\n\n<details><summary>sc